---
name: Paper Plane
ingredients:
  - type: Amaro Nonino
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Aperol
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Bourbon/whisky
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon juice
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
category:
  - whisky
image: ../../images/cocktails/paper-plane/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.grappanonino.it/en/aperitifs-and-cocktails/paper-plane/
---
1. Mix equal parts of Aperol, Bourbon, Amaro Nonino, and freshly-squeezed lemon juice.
1. Shake over ice and strain.
